[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D30A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D30B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D31A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Front right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D31B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the guard and release the electrical connections.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047444.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt fixing the door check strap.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and (2b) fixing the hinges.</p><p>3. Release the cable duct and release the door wiring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047445.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Lift up the door and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047446.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the front door is\nnot damaged.</p><p>If necessary touch up the paintwork.</p><p>Position the front door on the hinges.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the hinges to\nthe recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>SIDE DOORS</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolt fixing the door check\nstrap to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Bodyshell side) 2.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the wiring inside the housing\nin the bodyshell and position the cable duct.</p><p>Position the guard and connect the electrical\nconnections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Front left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D30A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Front left door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D30B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Front right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D31A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Front right door connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>D31B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a></p><p>Check the alignment of the front door and,\nif necessary, carry out the following procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753030\">7005A14</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]